# Environment variables for Firebase Functions
# Copy this file to .env for local development (it will not be committed to git).
#
# This project has been migrated away from the deprecated functions.config() API.
# See: https://firebase.google.com/docs/functions/config-env#migrate-to-dotenv
#
# Add any non-secret configuration values below.
# For secrets (API keys, passwords, etc.), use Firebase Secret Manager instead:
# https://firebase.google.com/docs/functions/config-env#secret-manager
#
# Example:
# SOME_CONFIG_VALUE=my-value
